    <string name="settings_privacy_sub">What DarkFrame reads, and what it does not</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">DarkFrame reads the list of apps that have a launcher icon,
        so it can theme them. That happens on your phone and nothing is transmitted — DarkFrame has
        no network code outside Google Play billing. It does not request broad package access, and
        it runs no background service.</string>
